<title>USA: Harvard Sci gets OK on erectile patent.</title>
<headline>Harvard Sci gets OK on erectile patent.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harvard Scientific Corp said Tuesday that the U.S. Patent and Trademark office notified it that it has allowed all claims of its patent application entitled PGE-1 Lyophilized Liposomes for use in the treatment of erectile dysfunction for issuance.</p>
</text>
